44,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Mio, the field crew delay is a dealbreaker for any hardware-heavy model.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,I prefer software that doesn't need outside appraisals. It keeps our books clean.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The exits were quiet back-office tools. We should stick to that proven pattern.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minako,,I am leaning towards assets that don't tie up our reserve accounts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
